# Closed codelist subsets and the registers that govern the marks. These are not
# ordinary content: a code in eventTypeCore.csv carries a fixed meaning that MUST NOT
# be redefined, and a register entry decides what may be claimed. Admission is a
# Standards Committee act, so the boundary is enforced by ownership and branch
# protection rather than by a reviewer noticing (CP-Grant-lifecycle R-G1).
# The open/closed split is additionally asserted in CI by
# conformance/rules/check-codelists.js.
/codelists/eventTypeCore.csv        @concertfoundation @concertcustodian
/governance/endorsement-register.md @concertfoundation @concertcustodian
/governance/role-register.md        @concertfoundation @concertcustodian
